    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44088" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθυπορ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go straight forward</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πότμος εὐθυπορῶν</span> (metaph. from a ship)
				<i>unswerving</i> destiny, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1005
			</span></i> (lyr.); of motion, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>IA</u>
				710a7
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακάμπτειν</span>, of
